@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Payment Recording & Receipt Generation Flow
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Receptionist" as Rec
boundary "Payment & Receipt UI" as UI
control "PaymentController" as PayCtrl
participant "PaymentService" as PaySvc
participant "PaymentStrategyContext" as StratCtx
participant "CashPaymentStrategy" as CashStrat
database "BillRepository" as BillRepo
database "PaymentRepository" as PayRepo
participant "ReceiptFactory" as Factory
participant "AuditService" as Audit

Rec -> UI: Selects Bill, Chooses Payment Method (CASH), Enters Amount Paid
UI -> PayCtrl: POST /api/payments (PaymentRequest)
activate PayCtrl

PayCtrl -> PaySvc: processPayment(request)
activate PaySvc

PaySvc -> BillRepo: findById(request.billId)
BillRepo --> PaySvc: Bill Entity

' Strategy Pattern Execution
PaySvc -> StratCtx: execute(request.paymentMethod, request.amountPaid)
activate StratCtx
StratCtx -> CashStrat: validateAndProcess(amountPaid, bill.totalAmount)
activate CashStrat
CashStrat --> StratCtx: success (true)
deactivate CashStrat
StratCtx --> PaySvc: success (true)
deactivate StratCtx

' Record Payment Entity
PaySvc -> PaySvc: generateNextPaymentNumber() -> "PAY-2026-000002"
PaySvc -> PayRepo: save(newPayment)

' Update Bill Payment Status
PaySvc -> BillRepo: updatePaymentStatus(billId, "PAID")

' Factory Pattern: Printable Receipt Generation
PaySvc -> Factory: createReceipt(bill, payment)
activate Factory
note over Factory: Assembles Clinic Header ("SUNRISE DENTAL CLINIC Colombo"),\nReceipt metadata, Patient info, Dentist, Treatment details,\nItemized fees, Payment method, and Footer note.
Factory --> PaySvc: ReceiptResponse DTO
deactivate Factory

PaySvc -> Audit: log("receptionist", "SETTLE_PAYMENT", "BILL", bill.billNumber)

PaySvc --> PayCtrl: ReceiptResponse DTO
PayCtrl --> UI: 200 OK (ReceiptResponse JSON)
deactivate PaySvc
deactivate PayCtrl

UI --> Rec: Render Official Printable Receipt Modal with window.print() trigger
@enduml
